                                    "id": "4d693914-9208-4441-ad3c-3f2051fe47a8",
                                    "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                                    "args": {
                                      "text": [
                                        "Which action\nfollows the\ncombined checks?\nThe bucket agrees\nwith the certified",
                                        "jug, the off line\nis empty, and the\nfixed needle\nclaims pressure.\nYou may inspect",
                                        "the gauge\nmechanism, replace\nthe verified\nbucket, or raise\npump power until",
                                        "the display looks\nright. Dot will\nrecord the reason\nbefore anyone\ntouches a tool."
                                      ],
